{"t": "Developer-API", "b": "<h1 id=\"developer-api\">Developer-API<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#developer-api\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h1>\n<p>OmniGuard biedt een getypeerde service in de <code>ServicesManager</code> van Bukkit, plus Bukkit-events. Een complete, compilerende voorbeeldplugin\nstaat in <a href=\"https://github.com/plisquante/OmniGuard/tree/main/examples/api-example\"><code>examples/api-example</code></a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"opzetten\">Opzetten<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#opzetten\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Voeg de OmniGuard-jar toe aan je compile-classpath (scope <code>provided</code> / <code>compileOnly</code>) en declareer de afhankelijkheid:</p>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># plugin.yml</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">depend</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">[</span><span class=\"nv\">OmniGuard</span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">]</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># or softdepend</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bukkit</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getServicesManager</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">load</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">class</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// OmniGuard not installed</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Gebruik alleen klassen uit <code>dev.omniguard.api</code> en <code>dev.omniguard.api.event</code>. Al het andere is intern en kan veranderen.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#omniguardservice\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Methode</th>\n<th>Beschrijving</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>version()</code></td>\n<td>Pluginversie</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isAttackMode()</code> / <code>setAttackMode(\"auto\"\\|\"on\"\\|\"off\")</code></td>\n<td>Aanvalsmodus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isMonitorMode()</code></td>\n<td>Alleen-detecteren-modus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isLockdown()</code> / <code>setLockdown(boolean)</code></td>\n<td>Lockdown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stats()</code></td>\n<td><code>StatsSnapshot(packets, blocked, kicks, refusedConnections, dupes, packetsPerSecond, blockedPerSecond, trackedItems)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>checks()</code></td>\n<td>Map van check-id → ingeschakeld</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getViolationLevel(uuid, checkId)</code> / <code>getViolations(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Huidige overtredingsniveaus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exempt(uuid, checkId, Duration)</code></td>\n<td>Tijdelijke uitzondering voor één check, of <code>\"*\"</code> voor alle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clearExemptions(uuid)</code> / <code>isExempt(uuid, checkId)</code></td>\n<td>Uitzonderingen beheren</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reportViolation(player, source, detail, amount)</code></td>\n<td>Je eigen detecties doorgeven aan de meldingen, Discord, logs van OmniGuard en de straffen van de <code>external</code>-check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getLinkedAccounts(name)</code></td>\n<td>Accounts die een IP deelden</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getItemIdentity(item)</code></td>\n<td>Ledger-identiteit van een item</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>trackItem(item)</code></td>\n<td>Een item nu meteen een identiteit geven (bijv. kratbeloningen); aanroepen op de thread die eigenaar is van het item</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getCustody(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Bewaarketen (<code>CustodyStep(timeMillis, holder)</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isCompromised(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Of bevestigd is dat de identiteit gedupliceerd is</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>Alle methoden zijn thread-safe behalve <code>trackItem</code>. Onbekende check-id's gooien <code>IllegalArgumentException</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"voorbeelden\">Voorbeelden<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#voorbeelden\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"een-speler-uitzonderen-tijdens-je-lanceerplatform\">Een speler uitzonderen tijdens je lanceerplatform<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#een-speler-uitzonderen-tijdens-je-lanceerplatform\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">exempt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getUniqueId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"invalid-movement\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">ofSeconds</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setVelocity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Vector</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"je-eigen-detectie-melden\">Je eigen detectie melden<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#je-eigen-detectie-melden\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">reportViolation</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"MyAntiCheat\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"reach 6.2 blocks\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"kratbeloningen-volgen\">Kratbeloningen volgen<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#kratbeloningen-volgen\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Material</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">NETHERITE_SWORD</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">UUID</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">trackItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getInventory</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">addItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"events\">Events<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#events\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Event</th>\n<th>Annuleerbaar</th>\n<th>Wanneer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardViolationEvent</code></td>\n<td>ja (onderdrukt melding en straf)</td>\n<td>Elke mislukte check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardPunishEvent</code></td>\n<td>ja (handel de straf zelf af)</td>\n<td>Vlak voor een kick of strafcommando's</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardDupeEvent</code></td>\n<td>ja (geen inbeslagname, geen melding)</td>\n<td>Een duplicaat is bevestigd</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardAttackModeEvent</code></td>\n<td>nee</td>\n<td>Aanvalsmodus begint of stopt</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Overtredings- en strafevents kunnen <strong>asynchroon</strong> zijn, omdat pakketchecks op Netty-threads draaien. Gebruik de scheduler voordat je de wereld aanraakt. Annuleren laat het kwaadaardige pakket nooit door.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nd\">@EventHandler</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">onPunish</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardPunishEvent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getCheckId</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">equals</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"packet-rate\"</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setCancelled</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">                         </span><span class=\"c1\">// no kick from OmniGuard…</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">jail</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getPlayerId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getDetail</span><span class=\"p\">());</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// …your own handling</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"statische-helper\">Statische helper<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#statische-helper\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>OmniGuardAPI</code> (statisch) bestaat nog steeds voor snelle uitlezingen: <code>isAttackMode()</code>, <code>getViolationLevel(...)</code>,\n<code>getBlockedCount(...)</code>, <code>getItemIdentity(...)</code> en <code>service()</code>, dat de volledige <code>OmniGuardService</code> teruggeeft.</p>", "c": "<a href=\"#opzetten\">Opzetten</a><a href=\"#omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService</a><a href=\"#voorbeelden\">Voorbeelden</a><a href=\"#events\">Events</a><a href=\"#statische-helper\">Statische helper</a>"}